[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4085066780","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117583#issuecomment-4085066780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117583","id":4085066780,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zfSwc","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-18T19:26:18Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T17:48:19Z","body":"I should mention that I tested `TRACY_ON_DEMAND` back when I looked into #113805 and ran into weird issues with it back then, where the Tracy client would throw some error popup when first connecting, saying something about out-of-order scope markers or something along those lines. Now it all seems to work fine though, for reasons I don't quite understand.\r\n\r\n~~Also, naming is hard. I figured `profiler_on_demand` didn't quite get the message across as well as `profiler_record_without_connection`. Mentioning a \"connection\" is obviously somewhat Tracy-specific though, so it's still a bit of a leaky abstraction. I'd be curious to hear other suggestions.~~\r\n\r\n~~EDIT: Maybe `profiler_on_demand_recording` is actually better though.~~","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4085066780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4092122562","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117583#issuecomment-4092122562","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117583","id":4092122562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7z6NXC","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-19T17:51:47Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T17:51:47Z","body":"I went ahead and renamed the build option from `profiler_record_without_connection` to `profiler_record_on_demand`. It seemed better after all, and I couldn't justify the confusion of having the build option be the inverse of the compile definition.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4092122562/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray"